can still be a lot of fun.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/03/31/theater/the-white-devil-review.html', 'snippet': 'Turns out that a Jacobean tragedy with a bleak worldview and an extensive body count can still be a lot of fun.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you find plausible psychology aggravating and a humane outlook just rubs you the wrong way, please meet John Webster. A playwright with a deep devotion to gore, he churned out some of the 17th-century’s most lurid tragedies and there was nothing — books, a helmet, a tennis racket, a fart — that he didn’t long to empoison. (The urchin from “Shakespeare in Love” who liked to torture mice? That’s him.) Red Bull Theater resurrects his 1612 play, “The White Devil” with mischief and raunch and sibling incest and maybe necrophilia, because hey, why not? Anyone expecting Shakespeare might see if the box office does refunds.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/01/arts/31whitedevil/merlin_152608611_0bebe5c1-76f6-4291-83d8-f68fb94a86af-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 614, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/01/arts/31whitedevil/merlin_152608611_0bebe5c1-76f6-4291-83d8-f68fb94a86af-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 614}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/01/arts/31whitedevil/merlin_152608611_0bebe5c1-76f6-4291-83d8-f68fb94a86af-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/01/arts/31whitedevil/merlin_152608611_0bebe5c1-76f6-4291-83d8-f68fb94a86af-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/01/arts/31whitedevil/merlin_152608611_0bebe5c1-76f6-4291-83d8-f68fb94a86af-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/01/arts/31whitedevil/merlin_152608611_0bebe5c1-76f6-4291-83d8-f68fb94a86af-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/01/arts/31whitedevil/merlin_152608611_0bebe5c1-76f6-4291-83d8-f68fb94a86af-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: In ‘The White Devil,’ Pick Your Poison', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Pick', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'If You Like Mischief and a High Body Count', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Red Bull Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The White Devil (Play)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Proske, Louisa', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Webster, John (1580-1634)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-04-01T01:45:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alexis Soloski', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alexis', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Soloski', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/b8851437-3474-5ed4-b9aa-adbc2e957481', 'word_count': 598, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b8851437-3474-5ed4-b9aa-adbc2e957481'}, {'abstract': 'Uneven pitching and sputtering hitting gave the Yankees a second straight loss to Baltimore, and gave J.A. Happ his first loss at Yankee Stadium since 2013.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/03/31/sports/yankees-orioles.html', 'snippet': 'Uneven pitching and sputtering hitting gave the Yankees a second straight loss to Baltimore, and gave J.A. Happ his first loss at Yankee Stadium since 2013.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Yankees and the Baltimore Orioles occupy different ends of the competition spectrum. The Yankees possess a far more talented roster, World Series expectations and a payroll that is around $130 million larger. The Orioles lost 115 games last season, and some analysts believe they could lose more this year with a pared-down roster.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/03/31/sports/31yankees-web/merlin_152909361_4c7dbafc-56ac-40d6-a69f-3137d9b0a55c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 394, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/03/31/sports/31yankees-web/merlin_152909361_4c7dbafc-56ac-40d6-a69f-3137d9b0a55c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 394}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/03/31/sports/31yankees-web/merlin_152909361_4c7dbafc-56ac-40d6-a69f-3137d9b0a55c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 672, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/03/31/sports/31yankees-web/merlin_152909361_4c7dbafc-56ac-40d6-a69f-3137d9b0a55c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1345, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/03/31/sports/31yankees-web/merlin_152909361_4c7dbafc-