riminal justice law known as the First Step Act.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/01/us/politics/first-step-act-donald-trump.html', 'snippet': 'Months after a major bipartisan bill passed, President Trump is promoting the criminal justice law known as the First Step Act.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Trump on Monday hosted about 300 guests, including convicted felons, at the White House for the “First Step Act Celebration,” a party intended to bring attention to a rare piece of bipartisan legislation he passed last year, and which he plans to highlight on the campaign trail.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/02/us/02dc-trump-print/merlin_152907918_4843b79f-bd23-4f5a-a03c-a03dec9b2e8b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/02/us/02dc-trump-print/merlin_152907918_4843b79f-bd23-4f5a-a03c-a03dec9b2e8b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/02/us/02dc-trump-print/merlin_152907918_4843b79f-bd23-4f5a-a03c-a03dec9b2e8b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/02/us/02dc-trump-print/merlin_152907918_4843b79f-bd23-4f5a-a03c-a03dec9b2e8b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/02/us/02dc-trump-print/01DC-TRUMPprint-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {