 you.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/01/nyregion/nyc-restaurants-bars-regulars.html', 'snippet': 'Does the waiter know your name? Do you have a standing spot at the bar? Then you’re a regular, and we want to hear from you.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You see them when you’re out to dinner — maybe not as often as you used to, but they’re there. The distinguished older gentleman at a table for one; the magnetic woman with a journal, a salad and a glass of chardonnay at the bar; the couple who enter a crowded bistro, air-kiss the hostess and are ushered to a two-top that has magically appeared. They are the regulars.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/03/29/nyregion/29regulars-1/fileupload-1553895405977-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/03/29/nyregion/29regulars-1/fileupload-1553895405977-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/03/29/nyregion/29regulars-1/fileupload-1553895405977-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/03/29/nyregion/29regulars-1/fileupload-1553895405977-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/03/29/nyregion/29regulars-1/29regulars-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/03/29/nyregion/29regulars-1/29regulars-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75