ion': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0cded6f3-4b4d-5f5e-8603-d874d0122913', 'word_count': 585, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0cded6f3-4b4d-5f5e-8603-d874d0122913'}, {'abstract': 'How I found a road map to my emotions on a decade-old online message board.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/02/magazine/letter-of-recommendation-personality-cafe.html', 'snippet': 'How I found a road map to my emotions on a decade-old online message board.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hollywood would have no trouble adapting the story of how my last relationship ended. There was a fateful trip to Hawaii. A lunar eclipse. A betrayal. But in reality, things did not feel like a movie. We had been dating for nearly five years, and the surprising revelations had a way of destabilizing my grip on the real world. How many parts of my life, I wondered, were mere illusions? I started to see duplicity everywhere. Surely my roommate, my friends and the mailwoman were all quietly plotting against me.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/07/magazine/07Mag-LOR-1/07Mag-LOR-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 437, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/07/magazine/07Mag-LOR-1/07Mag-LOR-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 437}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/07/magazine/07Mag-LOR-1/07Mag-LOR-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 745, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/07/magazine/07Mag-LOR-1/07Mag-LOR-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1491, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {