Trial and error leads to the perfect Filipino dessert.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/03/magazine/date-and-walnut-bars-food-for-the-gods.html', 'snippet': 'Trial and error leads to the perfect Filipino dessert.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the end of each school year, Margarita Manzke and her seven siblings piled into the family car in Manila, where her father ran a fish-sauce factory, to drive to her mother’s resort in Subic Bay, on the west coast of Luzon, about two hours away. They spent summers there, not swimming and sunbathing like other families on vacation from the city. Not bobbing down the waves on boogie boards, or falling asleep under umbrellas with books in one hand and drinks in the other. Even as a teenager, Manzke was an entrepreneur. And summertime, free from the structure of daily classes and homework, was for one thing, and one thing only: engaging in the sport of friendly competition with her brothers and sisters.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/07/magazine/07mag-eat-promo/07mag-eat-slideshow-slide-X5CG-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/07/magazine/07mag-eat-promo/07mag-eat-slideshow-slide-X5CG-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/07/magazine/07mag-eat-promo/07mag-eat-slideshow-slide-X5CG-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/07/magazine/07mag-eat-promo/07mag-eat-slideshow-slide-X5CG-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1638, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name':