78-72d2-50ba-a091-85e65359049f'}, {'abstract': 'I still don’t know where or in whose care my daughter was when we were apart. She’s still traumatized.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/03/opinion/border-honduras-separation-gangs.html', 'snippet': 'I still don’t know where or in whose care my daughter was when we were apart. She’s still traumatized.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — I am an asylum seeker from Honduras and a mother of three children. For over a month my youngest daughter was separated from her father and me by the United States government. I still don’t know where she was during that time or who took care of her. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/03/opinion/03Flores-sub/merlin_152997855_0cbb37bb-a701-4cec-b9f0-5eba261ab02c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/03/opinion/03Flores-sub/merlin_152997855_0cbb37bb-a701-4cec-b9f0-5eba261ab02c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/03/opinion/03Flores-sub/merlin_152997855_0cbb37bb-a701-4cec-b9f0-5eba261ab02c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/03/opinion/03Flores-sub/merlin_152997855_0cbb37bb-a701-4cec-b9f0-5eba261ab02c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/03/opinion/03Flores-sub/03Flores-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnai