direct yearning in his voice quickly found a wide audience.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/04/arts/03album-khalid1/merlin_152979495_45cb04c3-c8e1-4f8f-8b1d-ac7158d15577-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/04/arts/03album-khalid1/merlin_152979495_45cb04c3-c8e1-4f8f-8b1d-ac7158d15577-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/04/arts/03album-khalid1/merlin_152979495_45cb04c3-c8e1-4f8f-8b1d-ac7158d15577-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/04/arts/03album-khalid1/merlin_152979495_45cb04c3-c8e1-4f8f-8b1d-ac7158d15577-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1535, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/04/arts/03album-khalid1/03album-khalid1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/04/arts/03album-khalid1/03album-khalid1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/04/arts/03album-khalid1/03album-khalid1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Khalid Has Fresh Insecurities and a New Set of Musical Tricks on ‘Free Spirit’', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Pick', 'content_kicker