cutors.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/03/us/politics/house-intelligence-trump-inaugural.html', 'snippet': 'The panel is seeking information from Stephanie Winston Wolkoff, a top contractor to the inaugural committee, which is also under scrutiny by federal prosecutors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The House Intelligence Committee has asked one of the top contractors to President Trump’s inaugural to provide it with documents about the event, a person familiar with the situation said on Wednesday, opening up a new line of inquiry into the planning and financing of the ceremonies.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/03/us/03dc-inaugural-1/merlin_151531287_cff12c9a-d5e7-426d-afb0-31d28e1c48d7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/03/us/03dc-inaugural-1/merlin_151531287_cff12c9a-d5e7-426d-afb0-31d28e1c48d7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/03/us/03dc-inaugural-1/merlin_151531287_cff12c9a-d5e7-426d-afb0-31d28e1c48d7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/03/us/03dc-inaugural-1/merlin_151531287_cff12c9a-d5e7-426d-afb0-31d28e1c48d7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/03/us/03dc-inaugural-1/03dc-inaugural-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': '