esolution to end American involvement in the war in Yemen, presenting Democrats with a wrenching choice.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/03/us/politics/house-democrats-yemen-anti-semitism.html', 'snippet': 'House Republicans are expected to try to add an anti-Semitism amendment to a resolution to end American involvement in the war in Yemen, presenting Democrats with a wrenching choice.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — House Republicans are expected as soon as Thursday to try to add an amendment on anti-Semitism to a Yemen war resolution, giving Democrats a wrenching choice: Vote down the amendment amid charges that their party is coddling anti-Semites, or approve it and kill a hard-fought resolution aimed at ending American involvement in Saudi Arabia’s war.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/03/us/03dc-antisemitism-sub/merlin_152623056_0424dad4-4550-4654-bdd0-326308d61256-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/03/us/03dc-antisemitism-sub/merlin_152623056_0424dad4-4550-4654-bdd0-326308d61256-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/03/us/03dc-antisemitism-sub/merlin_152623056_0424dad4-4550-4654-bdd0-326308d61256-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/03/us/03dc-antisemitism-sub/merlin_152623056_0424dad4-4550-4654-bdd0-326308d61256-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': N