911', 'word_count': 1068, 'uri': 'nyt://article/20458d53-83d0-55d3-aa68-d3381ff25911'}, {'abstract': 'Tattooed almost head to foot himself, he helped move the art form “out of the back alley” and into the mainstream, finding fame with a celebrity clientele.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/03/obituaries/lyle-tuttle-dies.html', 'snippet': 'Tattooed almost head to foot himself, he helped move the art form “out of the back alley” and into the mainstream, finding fame with a celebrity clientele.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lyle Tuttle, a tattoo artist who found his own kind of international fame by catering to celebrities while helping to move tattooing, as he put it, from the “back alley” into mainstream acceptability, died on March 26 at his home in Ukiah, Calif., where he had grown up. He was 87 (and practically covered in tattoos himself).', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/07/obituaries/07Tuttle-obit2/merlin_152785818_030b8ebb-b3b2-44ce-86f4-dfcbed958d4e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 755, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/07/obituaries/07Tuttle-obit2/merlin_152785818_030b8ebb-b3b2-44ce-86f4-dfcbed958d4e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 755}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/07/obituaries/07Tuttle-obit2/merlin_152785818_030b8ebb-b3b2-44ce-86f4-dfcbed958d4e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 814, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/07/obituaries/07Tuttle-obit2/merlin_152785818_030b8ebb-b3b2-44ce-86f4-dfcbed958d4e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1628, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'l