co.html', 'snippet': 'The logic seems to go that everyone is better off, even minorities, when white people are calling the shots.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Donald Trump’s lie-filled rage tweets about Puerto Rico this week over disaster aid continue a Trump pattern that mirrors a method that white supremacists have used throughout American history. Particularly present since Reconstruction, this method involves proclaiming that minorities lack the character and capacity to create effective government, and therefore minority-led jurisdictions are a hopeless drain on resources.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/03/opinion/03BLOW/merlin_150194013_21713d9e-0d4c-47da-acab-4f301f5c0b1e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/03/opinion/03BLOW/merlin_150194013_21713d9e-0d4c-47da-acab-4f301f5c0b1e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/03/opinion/03BLOW/merlin_150194013_21713d9e-0d4c-47da-acab-4f301f5c0b1e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 687, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/03/opinion/03BLOW/merlin_150194013_21713d9e-0d4c-47da-acab-4f301f5c0b1e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1374, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/03/opinion/03BLOW/03BLOW-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/03/opinion/03BLOW/03BLOW-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailh