 'nyt://article/47da35fe-fddc-56d7-a769-f5b267b2bf7a'}, {'abstract': 'American manufacturers have added jobs for 19 straight months, a streak that could extend to 20 on Friday. But there are signs the growth is slowing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/04/business/economy-manufacturing-jobs-trump.html', 'snippet': 'American manufacturers have added jobs for 19 straight months, a streak that could extend to 20 on Friday. But there are signs the growth is slowing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For President Trump’s first two years in office, an unexpected rebound in manufacturing jobs helped bolster his claims that he was restoring the United States’ battered industrial sector. Now, that surge may be nearing its end — in part because of his own trade policies.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/04/business/04econ1/04econ1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 415, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/04/business/04econ1/04econ1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 415}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/04/business/04econ1/04econ1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 709, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/04/business/04econ1/04econ1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1417, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/04/business/04econ1/04econ1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/04/business/04econ1/04econ1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/04/business/04econ1/04econ1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Manufacturing Surge, a Boon for Trump, May Be Fading', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Industrial Surge, a Boon for Trump, May Be Fading', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Factories and Manufacturing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-04-04T09:00:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Casselman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Casselman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/55e6d8b1-d84f-50e3-8f4d-8723c382466e', 'word_count': 1382, 'uri': 'nyt://article/55e6d8b1-d84f-50e3-8f4d-8723c382466e'}, {'abstract': 'I faced constant sexual harassment in the corps. It was a side of the military neither of us wanted to see.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/04/magazine/marine-corps-sexual-harassment.html', 'snippet': 'I faced constant sexual harassment in the corps. It was a side of the military neither of us wanted to see.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It would be hard to overstate the significance the Marine Corps played in my family’s life. My father, Robert Starke, grew up in a small town in Eastern Oregon, enlisted in 1988 when he was 17 years old and went off to training at 18. My mother, Cindy, always says that the man who went to boot camp was not the same one who came back. The corps hardened him and shaped his ideas about raising a family. He and my mother married on Christmas Day that year, during his holiday leave following Marine Combat Training. She was still in high school. After her graduation the following spring, she joined him in Georgia, where he worked as a computer operator on a logistics base. My mother gave birth to a son and then to me — both before she could legally buy a drink.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/04/magazine/04atwar-marinefather-1/04atwar-marinefather-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/04/magazine/04atwar-marinefather-1/04atwar-marinefather-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/04/magazine/04atwar-marinefather-1/04atwar-marinefather-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/04/magazine/04atwar-marinefather-1/04atwar-marinefather-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/04/magazine/04atwar-marinefather-1/04atwar-marinefather-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/04/magazine/04atwar-marinefather-1/04atwar-marinefather-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/04/magazine/04atwar-marinefather-1/04atwar-marinefather-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'I Followed My Father Into the Marines. But It Was Different for a Woman.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Military Bases and Installations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sexual Harassment', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veterans', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Arlington National Cemetery', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Marine Corps', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-04-04T09:00:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cristine Pedersen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cristine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pedersen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8a10f8c0-9bb1-544f-a124-752ad44d2f27', 'word_count': 1568, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8a10f8c0-9bb1-544f-a124-752ad44d2f27'}, {'abstract': 'The attorney general turned a report of nearly 400 pages into a four-page summary. Members of the special counsel’s team say something was lost.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/04/podcasts/the-daily/mueller-report-barr-summary.html', 'snippet': 'The attorney general turned a report of nearly 400 pages into a four-page summary. Members of the special counsel’s team say something was lost.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Listen and subscribe to our podcast from your mobile device: Via Apple Podcasts | Via RadioPublic | Via Stitcher', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New Insights Into the Mueller Report', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barr, William P', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mueller, Robert S III', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Russian Interference in 2016 US Elections and Ties to Trump Associates', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Attorneys General', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Special Prosecutors (Independent Counsel)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-04-04T09:00:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Podcasts', 'section_name': 'Podcasts', 'subsection_name': 'The Daily', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b4966937-b877-51b5-af52-a9cf83283dab', 'word_count': 293, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b4966937-b877-51b5-af52-a9cf83283dab'}, {'abstract': 'The brain-tingling feeling was a hard-to-describe psychological oddity. Until, suddenly, it was a YouTube phenomenon.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/04/magazine/how-asmr-videos-became-a-sensation-youtube.html', 'snippet': 'The brain-tingling feeling was a hard-to-describe psychological oddity. Until, suddenly, it was a YouTube phenomenon.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Jennifer Allen watched videos of space, she sometimes felt this peculiar sensation: a tingling that spread through her scalp as the camera pulled back to show the marble of the earth. It came in a wave, like a warm effervescence, making its way down the length of her spine and leaving behind a sense of gratitude and wholeness. Allen loved this feeling, but she didn’t know what caused it. It was totally distinct from anything she’d experienced before. Every two years or so she’d take to Google. She tried searching things like “tingling head and spine” or “brain orgasm.” For nine years, the search didn’t turn up anything.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '57', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/07/magazine/07mag-asmr-slideshow-slide-GD4T/07mag-asmr-slideshow-slide-GD4T-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 733, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/07/magazine/07mag-asmr-slideshow-slide-GD4T/07mag-asmr-slideshow-slide-GD4T-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 733}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/07/magazine/07mag-asmr-slideshow-slide-GD4T/07mag-asmr-slideshow-slide-GD4T-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 838, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/07/magazine/07mag-asmr-slideshow-slide-GD4T/07mag-asmr-slideshow-slide-GD4T-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1676, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/07/magazine/07mag-asmr-slideshow-slide-GD4T/07mag-asmr-slideshow-slide-GD4T-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/07/magazine/07mag