article/20ea516d-70aa-583e-9dfa-f775caf0fdf6'}, {'abstract': 'They keep searching for a politically safe silver bullet that slays Obamacare and yet leaves everyone happy. That plan doesn’t exist.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/04/opinion/republicans-health-reforms.html', 'snippet': 'They keep searching for a politically safe silver bullet that slays Obamacare and yet leaves everyone happy. That plan doesn’t exist.', 'lead_paragraph': 'By backing a flimsy, state-initiated lawsuit to throw out the entirety of the Affordable Care Act, President Trump has made himself and Republican candidates in 2020 vulnerable to attacks that they want to take health insurance away from millions of people.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/04/opinion/04Santos-capretta/merlin_149653011_ac8fe38c-7e29-46b6-b1d8-c74bbe0197e5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 388, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/04/opinion/04Santos-capretta/merlin_149653011_ac8fe38c-7e29-46b6-b1d8-c74bbe0197e5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 388}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/04/opinion/04Santos-capretta/merlin_149653011_ac8fe38c-7e29-46b6-b1d8-c74bbe0197e5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 661, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/04/opinion/04Santos-capretta/merlin_149653011_ac8fe38c-7e29-46b6-b1d8-c74bbe0197e5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1323, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/04/opinion/04Santos-capretta/04Santos-capretta-thumbStandard.jpg',