as repeatedly promised to close the border over illegal immigration and drug smuggling, a decision that would have severe economic consequences.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/04/us/politics/mexico-border-trump.html', 'snippet': 'President Trump has repeatedly promised to close the border over illegal immigration and drug smuggling, a decision that would have severe economic consequences.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Trump said on Thursday that he planned to give Mexico a “one-year warning” before closing the southern border, retreating on a threat he made last week that he would close the border in the coming days if Mexico did not halt all illegal immigration.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Trump Retreats on Threat to Close Mexican Border, Offering a ‘One-Year Warning’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Softening Border Threat With ‘One-Year-Warning’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mexico', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Border Barriers', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-04-04T17:32:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Annie Karni a