their first date in Israel in May 2014. But it wasn’t until their second date — months later in Italy — that their romance took off.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Julian Olidort returned to his Manhattan office after a business trip to Israel five years ago, he said his first priority was “to assemble a team of co-workers” to assist in the delicate handling of a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity that emerged 6,000 miles away in Jerusalem and Tel Aviv. It was an investment he was eager to pursue.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/05/fashion/weddings/05VOWS1/merlin_153001176_481fbb84-f053-4108-88e8-2cd01b2dc199-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/05/fashion/weddings/05VOWS1/merlin_153001176_481fbb84-f053-4108-88e8-2cd01b2dc199-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/05/fashion/weddings/05VOWS1/merlin_153001176_481fbb84-f053-4108-88e8-2cd01b2dc199-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/05/fashion/weddings/05VOWS1/merlin_153001176_481fbb84-f053-4108-88e8-2cd01b2dc199-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/05/fashion/weddings/05VOWS1/05VOWS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/05/fashion/weddings/05VOWS1/05VOWS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwi