011.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/05/us/timmothy-pitzen-missing-brian-rini.html', 'snippet': 'The authorities charged Brian Rini, 23, who they say made a false statement to federal authorities, claiming to be a boy who had vanished in 2011.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For hours, he insisted that he was Timmothy Pitzen, a missing boy who had vanished in 2011 at the age of 6. He told the authorities that he had escaped from a hotel room where two men had been holding him captive for ages. He said that he had been physically and sexually abused.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/05/us/05hoax-02/merlin_153090468_2c221a2d-caec-4ae5-877a-d08b52ab1255-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/05/us/05hoax-02/merlin_153090468_2c221a2d-caec-4ae5-877a-d08b52ab1255-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 576}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/05/us/05hoax-02/merlin_153090468_2c221a2d-caec-4ae5-877a-d08b52ab1255-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 800, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/05/us/05hoax-02/merlin_153090468_2c221a2d-caec-4ae5-877a-d08b52ab1255-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 800, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/05/us/05hoax-02/05hoax-02-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/05/us/05hoax-02/05hoax-02-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 's