llowed false promises on social media that travel restrictions were about to be lifted.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATHENS — Hundreds of migrants gathered in a field next to a refugee camp in northern Greece on Friday, and scores more occupied the tracks of Athens’s central railway station, reacting to what the United Nations and the Greek government said were false rumors that restrictions keeping them from traveling to Northern Europe would be lifted.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/05/world/05greece1/merlin_153100752_978aec5a-b027-45d1-bbc1-d0ed4aa9be41-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/05/world/05greece1/merlin_153100752_978aec5a-b027-45d1-bbc1-d0ed4aa9be41-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/05/world/05greece1/merlin_153100752_978aec5a-b027-45d1-bbc1-d0ed4aa9be41-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/05/world/05greece1/merlin_153100752_978aec5a-b027-45d1-bbc1-d0ed4aa9be41-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/05/world/05greece1/05greece1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/05/world/05greece1/05greece1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credi