': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5747f78a-baa1-5186-ba77-dbc537ce277b', 'word_count': 495, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5747f78a-baa1-5186-ba77-dbc537ce277b'}, {'abstract': 'Unless he’s a glutton for punishment, he should not run. The times have changed more than he can grasp.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/05/opinion/joe-biden.html', 'snippet': 'Unless he’s a glutton for punishment, he should not run. The times have changed more than he can grasp.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I watched Joe Biden at the Munich Security Conference earlier this year. “We will be back, we will be back,” he declared. He meant the United States after the moral abdication of the Trump years. He also meant himself, the president-in-waiting who would wait no longer to reach the Oval Office.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/05/opinion/05cohenWeb/merlin_151956765_8887fd93-1242-4643-921b-b1c1fbfb69a7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/05/opinion/05cohenWeb/merlin_151956765_8887fd93-1242-4643-921b-b1c1fbfb69a7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/05/opinion/05cohenWeb/merlin_151956765_8887fd93-1242-4643-921b-b1c1fbfb69a7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/05/opinion/05cohenWeb/merlin_151956765_8887fd93-1242-4643-921b-b1c1fbfb69a7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'im