support a more liberal social agenda after a tour of poor, black areas of his state shocked him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/06/obituaries/ernest-hollings-dead.html', 'snippet': 'Once a foe of civil rights legislation, he came to support a more liberal social agenda after a tour of poor, black areas of his state shocked him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ernest F. Hollings, a silver-haired South Carolina Democrat who served 38 years in the United States Senate in an era of rising prosperity and often painful accommodation to racial tolerance in his state and across the South, died on Saturday at his home in Isle of Palms, S.C. He was 97.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/06/obituaries/06hollings3/c4bc85fa3ea349e49f7ec8723b457e67-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/06/obituaries/06hollings3/c4bc85fa3ea349e49f7ec8723b457e67-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 391}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/06/obituaries/06hollings3/c4bc85fa3ea349e49f7ec8723b457e67-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 667, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/06/obituaries/06hollings3/c4bc85fa3ea349e49f7ec8723b457e67-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1334, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/06/obituaries/06hollings3/06hollings3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/0