}, {'abstract': 'Have you considered the effects of what you eat on the planet, and made changes that will protect not only the Earth but also your health and the well-being of generations to come?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/08/well/eat/a-guide-to-sustainable-eating.html', 'snippet': 'Have you considered the effects of what you eat on the planet, and made changes that will protect not only the Earth but also your health and the well-being of generations to come?', 'lead_paragraph': 'I suspect most of you already do many things to help preserve the viability of the planet we all call home. Perhaps you recycle glass, plastic and paper and compost organic waste; shop with reusable bags; rely heavily on public transportation or bicycles or, failing that, at least drive fuel-efficient cars.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/09/science/09BRODYSUSTAINABLE/merlin_153141102_a0b8e1cd-1eaa-4523-92a0-e61b6b0627df-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/09/science/09BRODYSUSTAINABLE/merlin_153141102_a0b8e1cd-1eaa-4523-92a0-e61b6b0627df-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/09/science/09BRODYSUSTAINABLE/merlin_153141102_a0b8e1cd-1eaa-4523-92a0-e61b6b0627df-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/09/science/09BRODYSUSTAINABLE/merlin_153141102_a0b8e1cd-1eaa-4523-92a0-e61b6b0627df-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1302, 'width': 1965, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'th