last year, six days after we opened our (now my) dream restaurant. There is no more we. Just I. — Jennifer Brulé', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/03/11/fashion/XXTINYLOVE-SPRINGPROMO5/XXTINYLOVE-SPRINGPROMO5-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 417, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/03/11/fashion/XXTINYLOVE-SPRINGPROMO5/XXTINYLOVE-SPRINGPROMO5-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 417}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/03/11/fashion/XXTINYLOVE-SPRINGPROMO5/XXTINYLOVE-SPRINGPROMO5-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 712, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/03/11/fashion/XXTINYLOVE-SPRINGPROMO5/XXTINYLOVE-SPRINGPROMO5-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1309, 'width': 1882, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/03/11/fashion/XXTINYLOVE-SPRINGPROMO5/XXTINYLOVE-SPRINGPROMO5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/03/11/fashion/XXTINYLOVE-SPRINGPROMO5/XXTINYLOVE-SPRINGPROMO5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/03/11/fashion/XXTINYLOVE-SPRINGPROMO5/XXTINYLOVE-SPRINGPROMO5-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tiny Love Stories: ‘He Left Me on April Fools’ Day’', 'kicker': 'MODERN LOVE', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline