 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/ee60f78a-e124-5778-8a25-e4cb78f5b97e', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/ee60f78a-e124-5778-8a25-e4cb78f5b97e'}, {'abstract': 'Iran has used the Revolutionary Guard Corps to project power abroad through arming and funding paramilitary groups that target Iran’s enemies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/09/world/middleeast/iran-revolutionary-guards-.html', 'snippet': 'Iran has used the Revolutionary Guard Corps to project power abroad through arming and funding paramilitary groups that target Iran’s enemies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Trump’s declaration that Iran’s Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps is a foreign terrorist organization is the first time the United States government has designated a part of another country’s military as that type of threat. In doing so, Mr. Trump took broad aim at a pillar of the Iranian state, which exerts enormous influence in politics and the economy as well as in Iran’s internal and external military policies.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/09/world/09guards/merlin_153121071_fa1a6891-d991-4de7-bf76-f3e8fba7dea9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 385, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/09/world/09guards/merlin_153121071_fa1a6891-d991-4de7-bf76-f3e8fba7dea9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 385}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/09/world/09guards/merlin_153121071_fa1a6891-d991-4de7-bf76-f3e8fba7dea9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 658, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/09/world/09guards/merlin_1