: None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘He’s Doing a Great Job’: Trump Embraces Egypt’s Autocratic President', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Constitutions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Netanyahu, Benjamin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pompeo, Mike', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sisi, Abdel Fattah el-', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-04-09T23:39:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Landler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Landler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/67cd9248-659d-5cc6-84b0-1a3b297a09d9', 'word_count': 1075, 'uri': 'nyt://article/67cd9248-659d-5cc6-84b0-1a3b297a09d9'}, {'abstract': 'I’ve been living with diabetes since I was 9 years old. I used to dream of a cure, but now I just want to make sure people can get the drugs they need.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/09/opinion/insulin-drug-price-increase.html', 'snippet': 'I’ve been living with diabetes since I was 9 years old. I used to dream of a cure, but now I just want to make sure people can get the drugs they need.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My parents and I used to high-five one another when we learned that the child of someone very rich had been found to have Type 1 diabetes. We weren’t being mean, just desperate. I was given my diabetes diagnosis in 1987, when I was 9, and the years immediately following were spent fantasizing about a cure. A cure would solve all my problems, the physical, mental and financial strains of having a chronic illness. A cure would require fund-raising for charities that would then be able to sponsor life-changing research. Put more simply, a cure would require money — lots of it.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/09/opinion/09kreizman/merlin_153289158_e7a2019e-63aa-4b95-b3e0-a8be39e476b3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 722, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/09/opinion/09kreizman/merlin_153289158_e7a2019e-63aa-4b95-b3e0-a8be39e476b3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 722}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/09/opinion/09kreizman/merlin_153289158_e7a2019e-63aa-4b95-b3e0-a8be39e476b3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 851, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/09/opinion/09kreizman/merlin_153289158_e7a2019e-63aa-4b95-b3e0-a8be39e476b3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1701, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/09/opinion/09kreizman/09kreizman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/09/opinion/09kreizman/09kreizman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/09/opinion/09kreizman/09kreizman-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 