ization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/89322aab-2558-5b03-94d7-290594d3fe5f', 'word_count': 1180, 'uri': 'nyt://article/89322aab-2558-5b03-94d7-290594d3fe5f'}, {'abstract': 'Roberta Smith revisits the groundbreaking exhibition through one standout work. You’ll want to see it in person before the show closes on April 23.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/10/arts/design/hilma-af-klint-guggenheim.html', 'snippet': 'Roberta Smith revisits the groundbreaking exhibition through one standout work. You’ll want to see it in person before the show closes on April 23.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For me, the 2018-19 art season will always belong to the Swedish painter Hilma af Klint (1862-1944). I say this simply as a measure of the psychic and historical shift caused by the Guggenheim Museum’s extraordinary full-dress retrospective of her nearly 40-year career.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/12/arts/12lastchance-oak1/merlin_153234450_88ff0a82-c92e-4c4e-bbf0-3679a8636c39-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 798, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/12/arts/12lastchance-oak1/merlin_153234450_88ff0a82-c92e-4c4e-bbf0-3679a8636c39-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 798}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/12/arts/12lastchance-oak1/merlin_153234450_88ff0a82-c92e-4c4e-bbf0-3679a8636c39-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 770, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/12/arts/12lastchance-oak1/merlin_153234450_88ff0a82-c92e-4c4e-bbf0-3679a8636c39-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1