'}, {'abstract': 'To relieve Venezuela’s skyrocketing inflation, widespread blackouts and a growing health crisis, the Trump administration is demanding the ouster of President Nicolás Maduro.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/10/world/americas/pence-venezuela-un-envoy.html', 'snippet': 'To relieve Venezuela’s skyrocketing inflation, widespread blackouts and a growing health crisis, the Trump administration is demanding the ouster of President Nicolás Maduro.', 'lead_paragraph': 'UNITED NATIONS — Vice President Mike Pence on Wednesday urged the United Nations to revoke the credentials of Venezuela’s ambassador to the world body, portraying him as a loyalist to the country’s disputed president, Nicolás Maduro, and to a government that has allowed crime, violence and starvation to rise.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘You Shouldn’t Be Here’: U.S. Pushes U.N. to Pull Venezuela Envoy’s Credentials', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘Maduro’s Time Is Up,’ Pence Warns at the U.N.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Embargoes and Sanctions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Humanitarian Aid', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Security Council (UN)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pence, Mike', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Maduro, Nicolas', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Venezuela', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foreign Aid', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Guaido, Juan', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Dona