ckbuster season starting earlier than ever, an all-you-can-eat theater subscription sounds appealing. Then again so do gym memberships and subscription boxes. Likewise, whether they’re worth it depends on how you use them.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/08/14/us/politics/11sl-moviesubscriptions1/merlin_141974766_5a6a33c7-e5c8-443a-bf01-db88c91fa72f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/08/14/us/politics/11sl-moviesubscriptions1/merlin_141974766_5a6a33c7-e5c8-443a-bf01-db88c91fa72f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/08/14/us/politics/11sl-moviesubscriptions1/merlin_141974766_5a6a33c7-e5c8-443a-bf01-db88c91fa72f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/08/14/us/politics/11sl-moviesubscriptions1/merlin_141974766_5a6a33c7-e5c8-443a-bf01-db88c91fa72f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/08/14/us/politics/11sl-moviesubscriptions1/14dsouza4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/08/14/us/politics/11sl-moviesubscriptions1/14dsouza4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/08/14/us/politics/11sl-moviesubscriptions1/14dsouza4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 15