United in their Champions League tie, but it didn’t match the club’s lofty standards.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MANCHESTER, England — Sergi Roberto might have noticed Lionel Messi’s battle scars first: the slightly swollen nose, or the faint trace of a bruise, flowering around his left eye. Or he might have realized that the rest of the Argentine’s features were of far greater concern: Messi’s brow was furrowed. His face was set into a scowl. He was staring straight at his teammate. Roberto had let him down.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/10/sports/10onsoccer2/merlin_153337917_bd0d9e9c-57e4-4aa0-8e7c-7a5f4e84a9a8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/10/sports/10onsoccer2/merlin_153337917_bd0d9e9c-57e4-4aa0-8e7c-7a5f4e84a9a8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/10/sports/10onsoccer2/merlin_153337917_bd0d9e9c-57e4-4aa0-8e7c-7a5f4e84a9a8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/10/sports/10onsoccer2/merlin_153337917_bd0d9e9c-57e4-4aa0-8e7c-7a5f4e84a9a8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1053, 'width': 1582, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/10/sports/10onsoccer2/merlin_153337917_bd0d9e9c-57e4-4aa0-8e7c-7a5f4e84a9a8-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/10/sports/10onsoccer2/merlin_153337917