nyt://article/bc293df3-b422-599a-9a8b-b0cdc82d499a'}, {'abstract': 'House Democratic leaders criticized the president on immigration and Fed picks but also hoped to cut deals with him and Senate Republicans to deliver campaign promises.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/11/us/politics/pelosi-democrats-trump.html', 'snippet': 'House Democratic leaders criticized the president on immigration and Fed picks but also hoped to cut deals with him and Senate Republicans to deliver campaign promises.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LEESBURG, Va. — House Democrats insisted on Thursday that they remained optimistic about potential compromises with the Trump administration on infrastructure, prescription drugs prices and immigration, even as they criticized the president’s prospective Federal Reserve Board picks and his recent comments about migrants and asylum seekers.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/11/us/politics/11dc-dems/merlin_153330084_01d6fdee-23e2-4e8c-ab7a-afcd40849f75-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/11/us/politics/11dc-dems/merlin_153330084_01d6fdee-23e2-4e8c-ab7a-afcd40849f75-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/11/us/politics/11dc-dems/merlin_153330084_01d6fdee-23e2-4e8c-ab7a-afcd40849f75-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/11/us/politics/11dc-dems/merlin_153330084_01d6fdee-23e2-4e8c-ab7a-afcd40849f75-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'leg