he incident, a few weeks previously, when, on our way to a doctor’s appointment, my other kid looked up at me with a sunny smile and announced, “Guess what I am not wearing today!”)', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/11/opinion/11weiner/merlin_153394941_a48a473f-d198-4b72-8509-4360d74073dd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 720, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/11/opinion/11weiner/merlin_153394941_a48a473f-d198-4b72-8509-4360d74073dd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 720}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/11/opinion/11weiner/merlin_153394941_a48a473f-d198-4b72-8509-4360d74073dd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 854, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/11/opinion/11weiner/merlin_153394941_a48a473f-d198-4b72-8509-4360d74073dd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1707, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/11/opinion/11weiner/11weiner-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/11/opinion/11weiner/11weiner-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/11/opinion/11weiner/11weiner-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘What’s Your Favorite Book?’ Is Not a Trick Quest