recognize the albums bearing the names of the Irish playwright’s works?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/12/books/review/samuel-beckett-birthday-quiz.html', 'snippet': 'Can you recognize the albums bearing the names of the Irish playwright’s works?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Answers: Endgame: “Mona Bone Jakon” by Cat Stevens; Rockaby: “Elvis Presley” by Elvis Presley; Dreams of Fair to Middling Women: “Pieces of Eight” by Styx; Waiting for Godot: “In the Wee Small Hours” by Frank Sinatra; Krapp’s Last Tape: “Guardians of the Galaxy Original Soundtrack” by Various Artists; Rough for Radio: “Radio-Activity” by Kraftwerk; More Pricks Than Kicks: “Sticky Fingers” by the Rolling Stones; Ohio Impromptu: “Gene Krupa and His Orchestra” by Gene Krupa.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/12/books/review/12Lemire1/merlin_153371997_8baa2e1a-3637-400f-8412-34237311b220-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 646, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/12/books/review/12Lemire1/merlin_153371997_8baa2e1a-3637-400f-8412-34237311b220-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 646}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/12/books/review/12Lemire1/merlin_153371997_8baa2e1a-3637-400f-8412-34237311b220-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 700, 'width': 650, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/12/books/review/12Lemire1/merlin_153371997_8baa2e1a-3637-400f-8412-34237311b220-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 700, 'width': 650, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/12/books/review/12Lemire1/12Lemir