y-bloodlines-review.html', 'snippet': 'With Merce Cunningham’s playful “Tread” and Rudy Perez’s quiet, defiant “Coverage,” Bloodlines breathes new life into Mr. Petronio’s company.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the choreographer Stephen Petronio, Bloodlines developed out of a reverence for what had come before him. The initiative, now in its fifth season, was a way to both preserve American postmodern dance and pay homage to his influences. It’s accomplished more than that: It has breathed new life into his company.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/12/arts/12petronio-2/merlin_153399510_93349e49-dad2-48d1-82fa-5b3f5cd2e96e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 395, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/12/arts/12petronio-2/merlin_153399510_93349e49-dad2-48d1-82fa-5b3f5cd2e96e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 395}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/12/arts/12petronio-2/merlin_153399510_93349e49-dad2-48d1-82fa-5b3f5cd2e96e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 675, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/12/arts/12petronio-2/merlin_153399510_93349e49-dad2-48d1-82fa-5b3f5cd2e96e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1349, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/12/arts/12petronio-2/12petronio-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/12/arts/12petronio-2/12petronio-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, '