ian-dead.html', 'snippet': 'Considered one of the world’s best tuba players, he forged a successful career as a soloist and was a founding member of the quintet Empire Brass.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sam Pilafian, a virtuoso tuba player who performed an eclectic mix of classical, jazz, pop and rock music and brought unflagging exuberance to teaching young tubists, died on April 5 at his home in Tempe, Ariz. He was 69.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/11/obituaries/11Pilafian2/merlin_153237483_7f919752-d954-4151-a3f3-4b20d7000752-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 472, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/11/obituaries/11Pilafian2/merlin_153237483_7f919752-d954-4151-a3f3-4b20d7000752-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 472}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/11/obituaries/11Pilafian2/merlin_153237483_7f919752-d954-4151-a3f3-4b20d7000752-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 806, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/11/obituaries/11Pilafian2/merlin_153237483_7f919752-d954-4151-a3f3-4b20d7000752-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1613, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/11/obituaries/11Pilafian2/11Pilafian2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/11/obituaries/11Pilafian2/11Pilafian2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption'