il 14, 2019.', 'lead_paragraph': '“No one in New York, when I was a tracksuit-wearing local activist, would ever dream I would sit down with a Republican president or host ‘Saturday Night Live.’”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day: The Many Reasons to Run for President Even if Chances Are Slim', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quote of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2019-04-14T02:57:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Today’s Paper', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/0c3add71-34a2-5562-998b-b445ee8b8720', 'word_count': 44, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0c3add71-34a2-5562-998b-b445ee8b8720'}, {'abstract': 'The couple met in 2016 at a happy hour in Washington for fellows of a research and policy center, then reconnected a few months later on a dating app.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/14/fashion/weddings/martha-simms-eric-lorber.html', 'snippet': 'The couple met in 2016 at a happy hour in Washington for fellows of a research and policy center, then reconnected a few months later on a dating app.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Martha Randolph Simms and Eric Benjamin Lorber were married April 13 in Atlanta. The Rev. Timothy H. Black, an Episcopal priest, officiated at Cator Woolford Gardens, with Joyce Bihary, a retired chief judge of the federal bankruptcy court in Atlanta, taking part.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/14/fashion/weddings/14LORBER/14LORBER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 354, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/14/fashion/weddings/14LORBER/14LORBER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 354}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/14/fashion/weddings/14LORBER/14LORBER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 605, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/14/fashion/weddings/14LORBER/14LORBER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1210, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/14/fashion/weddings/14LORBER/14LORBER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/14/fashion/weddings/14LORBER/14LORBER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/14/fashion/weddings/14LORBER/14LORBER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Martha Simms, Eric Lorber', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Martha Simms,  Eric Lorber', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-04-14T04:00:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5c6633cf-c27f-54b3-a126-4f4e91ac8ad6', 'word_count': 379, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5c6633cf-c27f-54b3-a126-4f4e91ac8ad6'}, {'abstract': 'The couple were introduced in 2014 by the bride’s sister, who is married to one of 