': 'nyt://article/d31423cb-8db1-5816-bf91-b87f108dc717'}, {'abstract': 'Following a fracture, patients should have a bone density test, evaluation of calcium and vitamin D levels and, in nearly all cases, medication to protect against further bone loss.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/15/well/live/after-a-hip-fracture-reducing-the-risk-of-a-recurrence.html', 'snippet': 'Following a fracture, patients should have a bone density test, evaluation of calcium and vitamin D levels and, in nearly all cases, medication to protect against further bone loss.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Just as lightning can strike the same target more than once in a given storm, hip fractures can and do happen again to the same person. Yet, more often than not, people who fracture a hip do not get follow-up treatment that could prevent another fracture.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/21/science/21BRODYHIP/merlin_153271242_f6ba0dc6-410a-4f5f-a222-059f051ec361-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/21/science/21BRODYHIP/merlin_153271242_f6ba0dc6-410a-4f5f-a222-059f051ec361-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/21/science/21BRODYHIP/merlin_153271242_f6ba0dc6-410a-4f5f-a222-059f051ec361-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/21/science/21BRODYHIP/merlin_153271242_f6ba0dc6-410a-4f5f-a222-059f051ec361-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1302, 'width': 1965, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thum