me arroz con pollo or a superfast pasta with spinach sauce.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/15/dining/what-to-cook-right-now.html', 'snippet': 'Go easy on yourself, and make a tuna poke, some arroz con pollo or a superfast pasta with spinach sauce.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. This weekend was a drag for some of our number, hours spent at the kitchen table with piles of receipts and chicken-scratched figures on scrap paper amid drifts of pink eraser snow, all in advance of filing their taxes this morning on the way to work. (For others it still is, knowing they have pages to finish before the midnight deadline at the post office.) So I’m going easy on everyone for dinner tonight, and recommending a barnburner-good meal: local tuna poke (above).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/14/magazine/14mag-eat-image1/14mag-eat-image1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/10/14/magazine/14mag-eat-image1/14mag-eat-image1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/14/magazine/14mag-eat-image1/14mag-eat-image1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 597, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/14/magazine/14mag-eat-image1/14mag-eat-image1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1193, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/14/magazine/14mag-eat-image1/14mag-eat-image1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/10/14/magazine/14mag-eat-image1/14mag-eat-image1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/14/magazine/14mag-eat-image1/14mag-eat-image1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What to Cook Right Now', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-04-15T14:30:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Sifton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sifton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/82b91174-1b14-5748-89c1-f97bff699d8a', 'word_count': 641, 'uri': 'nyt://article/82b91174-1b14-5748-89c1-f97bff699d8a'}, {'abstract': 'After his Masters triumph, fans began looking ahead. Is he back, after a decade of injury and personal adversity? Or was the comeback a last hurrah?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/15/sports/whats-next-for-tiger-woods.html', 'snippet': 'After his Masters triumph, fans began looking ahead. Is he back, after a decade of injury and personal adversity? Or was the comeback a last hurrah?', 'lead_paragraph': 'The cheers were still reverberating around Augusta National after Tiger Woods’s  triumph in the Masters on Sunday, but fans were already starting to look ahead. Is Woods back after a decade of injury and personal adversity? Could he, at age 43, regain the form that had him destroying fields from 1997 to 2008? Or was the comeback a kind of fool’s gold, a last hurrah before the decline sets in again?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/15/world/15tiger-next/merlin_153532197_5b40dad1-1782-4254-bf9a-204027e4114e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 335, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/15/world/15tiger-next/merlin_153532197_5b40dad1-1782-4254-bf9a-204027e4114e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 335}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/15/world/15tiger-next/merlin_153532197_5b40dad1-1782-4254-bf9a-204027e4114e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 571, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/15/world/15tiger-next/merlin_153532197_5b40dad1-1782-4254-bf9a-204027e4114e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1142, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/15/world/15tiger-next/15tiger-next-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/15/world/15tiger-next/15tiger-next-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/15/world/15tiger-next/15tiger-next-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s Next for Tiger Woods?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Woods, Tiger', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name':