ding, Mulvaney had begun another kind of reconstruction, one that would shift the balance of power between the politically influential industries that lend money and the hundreds of millions of Americans who borrow it.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mick Mulvaney’s Master Class in Destroying a Bureaucracy From Within', 'kicker': 'Feature', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': ' Make America Pay Again', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mulvaney, Mick', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Consumer Financial Protection Bureau', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Consumer Protection', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit and Debt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Payday Loans', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dodd-Frank Wall Street Reform and Consumer Protection Act (2010)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Personal Finances', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Advance America', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blankenstein, Eric (1979- )', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cordray, Richard', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Brian C (1979- )', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Warren, Elizabeth', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-04-16T09:00:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Confessore', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Confessore', 'qualifier': None, 'title'