sh photographer captures its contradictions and ambiguities with a sense of humor.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/17/lens/will-martin-parrs-photos-change-britain-he-doesnt-think-so.html', 'snippet': 'In documenting his homeland, the British photographer captures its contradictions and ambiguities with a sense of humor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Martin Parr is something of a cottage industry in Britain. The photographer’s name, likeness and work have adorned M&M’s, leather jackets, soccer scarves and Bombay Sapphire gin, among other things. He currently has solo exhibitions in Bogotá, Manchester and London and has published more than 100 books. He was also the president of Magnum Photos from 2013-17.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/17/lens/17Parr1/17Parr1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/17/lens/17Parr1/17Parr1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/17/lens/17Parr1/17Parr1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/17/lens/17Parr1/17Parr1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/17/lens/17Parr1/17Parr1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/17/lens/17Parr1/17Parr1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'c