 and veteran politicians.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/17/us/politics/terry-mcauliffe-president.html', 'snippet': 'The former Virginia governor concluded that his moderate profile would have limited appeal when Democrats appear to be choosing between younger, progressive contenders and veteran politicians.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Former Gov. Terry McAuliffe of Virginia said Wednesday he would not run for president, concluding that his moderate profile would have limited appeal when Democratic voters appear to be choosing between younger, progressive contenders and veteran politicians like Senator Bernie Sanders and former Vice President Joseph R. Biden Jr., who is expected to enter the race next week.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/17/us/17mcauliffe/merlin_153318786_2588dae9-f615-457d-92bf-4e4628abce9d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/17/us/17mcauliffe/merlin_153318786_2588dae9-f615-457d-92bf-4e4628abce9d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/17/us/17mcauliffe/merlin_153318786_2588dae9-f615-457d-92bf-4e4628abce9d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/17/us/17mcauliffe/merlin_153318786_2588dae9-f615-457d-92bf-4e4628abce9d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/17/us/17mcauliffe/17mcauliffe-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subTyp