azine/judge-john-hodgman-on-professional-gamers.html', 'snippet': 'How lazy is a would-be streamer allowed to be?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jeremy writes: A friend of mine, Sigh, has been trying to become a video-game streamer for a while. Recently he was invited to become a “partner,” meaning he can start making money off his channel. He just needs to file some simple paperwork. It has been a month, and he still hasn’t done it. I would like you to order him to file the paperwork.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/12/magazine/Mag-Hodgman-1/Mag-Hodgman-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/12/magazine/Mag-Hodgman-1/Mag-Hodgman-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/12/magazine/Mag-Hodgman-1/Mag-Hodgman-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/12/magazine/Mag-Hodgman-1/Mag-Hodgman-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/12/magazine/Mag-Hodgman-1/Mag-Hodgman-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/02/12/magazine/Mag-Hodgman-1/Mag-Hodgman-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/12/magazine/Mag-Hodgman-1/M