 as a clear nod that Congress should make its own judgment on obstruction of justice.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — House Democrats, facing some of the most striking evidence yet from Robert S. Mueller III that President Trump attempted to thwart his investigation, edged closer on Thursday to confronting a question they have long tried to avoid: whether the president’s behavior warrants impeachment.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Democrats Draw Closer to a Dicey Question: Whether to Impeach Trump', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Decision Looms For Democrats: Try to Impeach? ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Impeachment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Russian Interference in 2016 US Elections and Ties to Trump Associates', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nadler, Jerrold', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pelosi, Nancy', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mueller, Robert S III', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-04-19T01:12:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Fandos', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fandos', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c2fef5ff-41ce-52f2-a85c-cd2af54c43d7', 'word_count': 1186, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c2fef5ff-41ce-52f2-a85c-cd2af54c43d7'}, {'abstract': 'After Trump’s vindication, the liberal media and its allies in government should face a reckoning. I’m not holding my breath.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/18/opinion/barr-media-trump.html', 'snippet': 'After Trump’s vindication, the liberal media and its allies in government should face a reckoning. I’m not holding my breath.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The American political and media elites that spent the first two years of the Trump administration promoting the Russian collusion hoax have some explaining to do. And not merely explaining: They owe the president an apology.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/18/opinion/18Buskirk/18Buskirk-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/18/opinion/18Buskirk/18Buskirk-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/18/opinion/18Buskirk/18Buskirk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/18/opinion/18Buskirk/18Buskirk-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/18/opinion/18Buskirk/18Buskirk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/18/opinion/18Buskirk/18Buskirk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge'