owed to investigate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The 35-page dossier, spiced up with tales of prostitutes and spies, sketched out a hair-raising story more than two years ago. Russian intelligence had used bribery and blackmail to try to turn Donald J. Trump into a source and ally, it said, and the Kremlin was running some Trump campaign aides practically as agents.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/18/obituaries/archives/00dossier-orbis/merlin_153692079_82d0a212-301b-4b0b-a78d-c57a4edaddbb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/18/obituaries/archives/00dossier-orbis/merlin_153692079_82d0a212-301b-4b0b-a78d-c57a4edaddbb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 380}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/18/obituaries/archives/00dossier-orbis/merlin_153692079_82d0a212-301b-4b0b-a78d-c57a4edaddbb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 649, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/18/obituaries/archives/00dossier-orbis/merlin_153692079_82d0a212-301b-4b0b-a78d-c57a4edaddbb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1298, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/18/obituaries/archives/00dossier-orbis/merlin_153692079_82d0a212-301b-4b0b-a78d-c57a4edaddbb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/18/obituaries/archives/00dossier-orbis/merlin_153692079_82d0a212-301b-4b0b-a78d-c57a4eda