sis', '_id': 'nyt://article/8e350635-6ff7-5110-964f-83d0881d4acf', 'word_count': 1186, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8e350635-6ff7-5110-964f-83d0881d4acf'}, {'abstract': 'A perceived victory for Russian interference poses a serious risk for the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/19/opinion/mueller-report-trump-russia.html', 'snippet': 'A perceived victory for Russian interference poses a serious risk for the United States.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The report of the special counsel Robert Mueller leaves considerable space for partisan warfare over the role of President Trump and his political campaign in Russia’s interference in the 2016 election. But one conclusion is categorical: “The Russian government interfered in the 2016 presidential election in sweeping and systematic fashion.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/19/opinion/19MuellerRussia/703621e14b464c97a1e8536b7d571906-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/19/opinion/19MuellerRussia/703621e14b464c97a1e8536b7d571906-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/19/opinion/19MuellerRussia/703621e14b464c97a1e8536b7d571906-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 598, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/19/opinion/19MuellerRussia/703621e14b464c97a1e8536b7d571906-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1196, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/19/opinion/19Muell