rial', '_id': 'nyt://article/d9cae63d-dfda-519c-a552-e67d00a35b23', 'word_count': 1025, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d9cae63d-dfda-519c-a552-e67d00a35b23'}, {'abstract': 'In an era of deep polarization, Mr. Mueller’s 448-page report quickly became yet another case study in the disparate realities of American politics.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/19/us/politics/mueller-report-democrats-republicans.html', 'snippet': 'In an era of deep polarization, Mr. Mueller’s 448-page report quickly became yet another case study in the disparate realities of American politics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — House Democrats vowed on Friday to pursue the revelations in the special counsel’s report on President Trump but drew little Republican support in a nation still deeply polarized over the investigation that has dogged the White House for two years.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/19/us/politics/19dc-trump1/merlin_153722478_f6c77d2d-a928-4741-aff9-8f10389b6b6a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/19/us/politics/19dc-trump1/merlin_153722478_f6c77d2d-a928-4741-aff9-8f10389b6b6a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/19/us/politics/19dc-trump1/merlin_153722478_f6c77d2d-a928-4741-aff9-8f10389b6b6a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/19/us/politics/19dc-trump1/merlin_153722478_f6c77d2d-a928-4741-aff9-8f10389b6b6a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy