'nyt://article/1ff1f002-b4e1-5bf2-8047-5569a5f5fdc6'}, {'abstract': 'President Trump’s personal lawyer said statements about Mr. Trump from the president’s former White House counsel were inaccurate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/19/us/politics/giuliani-mcgahn-trump-mueller.html', 'snippet': 'President Trump’s personal lawyer said statements about Mr. Trump from the president’s former White House counsel were inaccurate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Trump’s lawyer, Rudolph W. Giuliani, attacked the credibility of a former White House counsel on Friday, saying his account of how Mr. Trump told him to remove the special counsel was inaccurate.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/19/books/19dc-McGahn/merlin_135192846_8e1cc94b-57ce-4097-b343-a30ca18090a9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 449, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/19/books/19dc-McGahn/merlin_135192846_8e1cc94b-57ce-4097-b343-a30ca18090a9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 449}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/19/books/19dc-McGahn/merlin_135192846_8e1cc94b-57ce-4097-b343-a30ca18090a9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 767, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/19/books/19dc-McGahn/merlin_135192846_8e1cc94b-57ce-4097-b343-a30ca18090a9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1534, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/19/books/19dc-McGahn/19dc-McGahn-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStanda