ir redemption stories.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last Sunday, when Tiger Woods won the Masters after his long drought, it was more than just one of the most incredible comebacks in history. It showed America’s eagerness to embrace a man who persevered through years of setbacks, especially self-inflicted ones, regardless of whatever selective amnesia that requires.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/21/opinion/21crouse/merlin_153528930_b36abcda-c715-41f9-bbcd-517373cf50e8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/21/opinion/21crouse/merlin_153528930_b36abcda-c715-41f9-bbcd-517373cf50e8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/21/opinion/21crouse/merlin_153528930_b36abcda-c715-41f9-bbcd-517373cf50e8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 688, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/21/opinion/21crouse/merlin_153528930_b36abcda-c715-41f9-bbcd-517373cf50e8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1376, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/21/opinion/21crouse/21crouse-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/21/opinion/21crouse/21crouse-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/21/opinion/21crouse/21crouse-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Why Don’t Women Get Comebacks Like Tiger Woods?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Women Don’t Get  Comebacks Like Tiger', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Athletics and Sports', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Masters Golf Tournament', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baiul, Oksana', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Serena', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Woods, Tiger', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-04-20T18:30:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lindsay Crouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lindsay', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Crouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News Analysis', '_id': 'nyt://article/17af768c-56a4-5cab-810f-8972318848bc', 'word_count': 1093, 'uri': 'nyt://article/17af768c-56a4-5cab-810f-8972318848bc'}, {'abstract': 'The Green New Deal has been called a political “loser.” But back in 1988, both parties saw climate legislation as sensible.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/20/opinion/alexandria-ocasio-cortez-green-new-deal.html', 'snippet': 'The Green New Deal has been called a political “loser.” But back in 1988, both parties saw climate legislation as sensible.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was not so long ago that a young congresswoman proposed major climate legislation that would transform the national energy system and, with it, the economy. Speaking on the floor of the House, she lamented the tens of billions of dollars in federal handouts to the fossil fuel industry and the government’s failure to adopt its own scientists’ recommendations. She warned of the “very high risk of irreversible and catastrophic impact looming on the horizon” if the United States failed to act.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/21/opinion/sunday/21rich/merlin_150320142_6d55a57c-4560-4b02-ab5e-e38f4c81f101-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/21/opinion/sunday/21rich/merlin_150320142_6d55a57c-4560-4b02-ab5e-e38f4c81f101-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/21/opinion/sunday/21rich/merlin_150320142_6d55a57c-4560-4b02-ab5e-e38f4c81f101-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/21/opinion/sunday/21rich/merlin_150320142_6d55a57c-4560-4b02-ab5e-e38f4c81f101-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/21/opinion/sunday/21rich/merlin_150320142_6d55a57c-4560-4b02-ab5e-e38f4c81f101-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/21/opinion/sunday/21rich/merlin_150320142_6d55a57c-4560-4b02-ab5e-e38f4c81f101-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/21/opinion/sunday/21rich/merlin_150320142_6d55a57c-4560-4