 domestic manufacturers instead padded profits and raised prices on a wide variety of laundry items.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/21/business/trump-tariffs-washing-machines.html', 'snippet': 'New research shows how a move meant to aid domestic manufacturers instead padded profits and raised prices on a wide variety of laundry items.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Trump’s decision to impose tariffs on imported washing machines has had an odd effect: It raised prices on washing machines, as expected, but also drove up the cost of clothes dryers, which rose by $92 last year.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/22/business/22-DC-WASHERS-01-PRINT/merlin_148380828_10a73083-1916-409c-9338-86e3ce5a1f43-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 367, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/22/business/22-DC-WASHERS-01-PRINT/merlin_148380828_10a73083-1916-409c-9338-86e3ce5a1f43-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 367}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/22/business/22-DC-WASHERS-01-PRINT/merlin_148380828_10a73083-1916-409c-9338-86e3ce5a1f43-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 626, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/22/business/22-DC-WASHERS-01-PRINT/merlin_148380828_10a73083-1916-409c-9338-86e3ce5a1f43-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1252, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/22/business/22-DC-WASHERS-01-PRINT/21DC-WASHERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail'