king swings, making throws or engaging in other nebulous baseball activities before Sunday morning’s news was delivered. The superstar right fielder Aaron Judge has a “pretty significant” oblique strain, Boone said, which will require a couple weeks of rest and an uncertain timeline for return.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/21/sports/21yankees2/21yankees2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/21/sports/21yankees2/21yankees2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/21/sports/21yankees2/21yankees2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/21/sports/21yankees2/21yankees2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/21/sports/21yankees2/21yankees2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/21/sports/21yankees2/21yankees2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/21/sports/21yankees2/21yankees2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Aaron Judge Hits Injured List, but the Depleted Yankees Win Again', 'kicker': 'Yankees 7, Royals 6 | 10 innings', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Yanks Win as Judge Joins I.L.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sports Injuries', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kansas City Royals', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Judge, Aaron (1992- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boone, Aaron', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romine, Austin', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-04-21T23:21:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joe Lemire', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lemire', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a8de0454-b91d-5704-8a32-f4dfcfeb6a82', 'word_count': 943, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a8de0454-b91d-5704-8a32-f4dfcfeb6a82'}, {'abstract': 'Before we set our sights on other planets, let’s take better care of Earth.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/21/opinion/earth-day-mars.html', 'snippet': 'Before we set our sights on other planets, let’s take better care of Earth.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A couple of years ago, I was a guest on a comedy and science panel discussion — a combination that works well because when you laugh your mouth opens, allowing information to float freely in to your head. We were talking about the possibility of travel to Mars. The conversation had turned to how moving to Mars would be useful if and when we wreck our own planet.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/21/opinion/21higgins1/21higgins1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/21/opinion/21higgins1/21higgins1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/21/opinion/21higgins1/21higgins1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/21/opinion/21higgins1/21higgins1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/21/opinion/21higgins1/21higgins1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/21/opinion/21higgins1/21higgins1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/21/opinion/21higgins1/21higgins1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Life on Mars Should Not Look This Appealing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mars (Planet)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Earth', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-04-21T23:25:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Maeve Higgins', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Maeve', 'middlename': None, 'lastnam