ed tourism’ to Cuba. Here’s what that could mean for U.S. travelers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/22/travel/cuba-travel-trump-rules.html', 'snippet': 'The Trump administration said it would crack down on ‘veiled tourism’ to Cuba. Here’s what that could mean for U.S. travelers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For Americans who want to visit Cuba, things got even murkier as the Trump administration last week said that it would further restrict nonfamily travel to the island. ', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/05/travel/18cuba-travel/merlin_102835636_c1ae76e3-3ba1-47ac-8974-ea81756b78b0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/05/travel/18cuba-travel/merlin_102835636_c1ae76e3-3ba1-47ac-8974-ea81756b78b0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/05/travel/18cuba-travel/merlin_102835636_c1ae76e3-3ba1-47ac-8974-ea81756b78b0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/05/travel/18cuba-travel/merlin_102835636_c1ae76e3-3ba1-47ac-8974-ea81756b78b0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/05/travel/18cuba-travel/18cuba-travel-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/05/05/travel/18cuba-travel/18cuba-travel-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumb