sostre-overlooked.html', 'snippet': 'The lawsuits he filed from behind bars in the 1960s and ’70s challenging harsh prison conditions laid the groundwork for prisoners to defend their rights even today.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Overlooked is a series of obituaries about remarkable people whose deaths, beginning in 1851, went unreported in The Times. The project began in 2018 with a focus on women, but it’s widening its lens this year.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/29/obituaries/29overlooked-blh-obit/00overlooked-blh-slide-36YH-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 724, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/29/obituaries/29overlooked-blh-obit/00overlooked-blh-slide-36YH-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 724}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/29/obituaries/29overlooked-blh-obit/00overlooked-blh-slide-36YH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 850, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/29/obituaries/29overlooked-blh-obit/00overlooked-blh-slide-36YH-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1809, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/29/obituaries/29overlooked-blh-obit/00overlooked-blh-slide-36YH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/29/obituaries/29overlooked-blh-obit/00overlooked-blh-slide-36YH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'capt