actical solution to help ease this seasonal transition: a bounty of utility-inspired pieces that are elegant, adaptable and, in some cases, weatherproof. Looks in functional fabrics such as gabardine and khaki cotton twill, often finished with cargo pockets and zippers, abounded on the runways, putting a modern spin on traditional work-wear staples. Here, a roundup of our favorite functional spring pieces — and how to wear them.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/25/t-magazine/25tmag-essentials-slide-MSAW-copy/25tmag-essentials-slide-MSAW-copy-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/25/t-magazine/25tmag-essentials-slide-MSAW-copy/25tmag-essentials-slide-MSAW-copy-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/25/t-magazine/25tmag-essentials-slide-MSAW-copy/25tmag-essentials-slide-MSAW-copy-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/25/t-magazine/25tmag-essentials-slide-MSAW-copy/25tmag-essentials-slide-MSAW-copy-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/25/t-magazine/25tmag-essentials-slide-MSAW-copy/25tmag-essentials-slide-MSAW-copy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/25/t-magazine/25tmag-essentials-slide-MSAW-copy/25tmag-essentials-slide-MSAW-copy-th