88 film, this hyperkinetic musical, starring Alex Brightman as a madcap ghoul, tries too hard to haunt.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/25/theater/beetlejuice-review-broadway.html', 'snippet': 'Adapted from Tim Burton’s 1988 film, this hyperkinetic musical, starring Alex Brightman as a madcap ghoul, tries too hard to haunt.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The dead lead lives of noisy desperation in “Beetlejuice,” the absolutely exhausting new musical that opened on Thursday at the Winter Garden Theater. This frantic adaptation of Tim Burton’s much-loved 1988 film is sure to dishearten those who like to think of the afterlife as one unending, undisturbed sleep.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/26/arts/26BEETLEJUICE-A/merlin_153031416_7f0cff39-69e0-4c10-b75d-381b5d555902-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 414, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/26/arts/26BEETLEJUICE-A/merlin_153031416_7f0cff39-69e0-4c10-b75d-381b5d555902-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 414}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/26/arts/26BEETLEJUICE-A/merlin_153031416_7f0cff39-69e0-4c10-b75d-381b5d555902-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 706, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/26/arts/26BEETLEJUICE-A/merlin_153031416_7f0cff39-69e0-4c10-b75d-381b5d555902-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1411, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/26/arts/26BEETLEJUICE-A/26BEETLEJUICE-A-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75