1591, 'uri': 'nyt://article/93e8ccb1-6836-524b-a437-2c8d40a00839'}, {'abstract': 'Four years ago, Barack Obama gently discouraged him from running for president, but Joseph R. Biden Jr. is back and presenting himself as Mr. Obama’s natural heir.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/28/us/politics/barack-obama-biden.html', 'snippet': 'Four years ago, Barack Obama gently discouraged him from running for president, but Joseph R. Biden Jr. is back and presenting himself as Mr. Obama’s natural heir.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Barack Obama did not think Joseph R. Biden Jr. should run for president — he hardly needed to say it out loud for aides to understand that. The trick that summer of 2015 was finding a way to nudge Mr. Biden to stay out of the race without looking as if he was nudging Mr. Biden to stay out of the race.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/26/us/politics/00dc-bidenobama-1-alt/merlin_25700001_8179b8f7-cec9-4954-b615-4933671a8a35-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/26/us/politics/00dc-bidenobama-1-alt/merlin_25700001_8179b8f7-cec9-4954-b615-4933671a8a35-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/26/us/politics/00dc-bidenobama-1-alt/merlin_25700001_8179b8f7-cec9-4954-b615-4933671a8a35-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/26/us/politics/00dc-bidenobama-1-alt/merlin_25700001_8179b8f7-cec9-4954-b615-4933671a8a35-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': '