 more than winning. And the manic drive for scholarships is alien. Are there lessons for the United States?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/28/sports/norway-youth-sports-model.html', 'snippet': 'Most children play organized sports in Norway, but enjoyment is prized more than winning. And the manic drive for scholarships is alien. Are there lessons for the United States?', 'lead_paragraph': 'A decade ago, I wrote a book that comprehensively surveyed the landscape of youth sports. I wanted to know: How did the United States become the world’s sports superpower while producing such a physically inactive population? What contribution, if any, did our sports ecosystem play in producing these seemingly opposite outcomes? And, has any nation figured out a more effective model?', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/28/sports/28norwaysports-sub/merlin_153967380_e23cabbc-eb5e-4793-9c7a-0742426de3a8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/28/sports/28norwaysports-sub/merlin_153967380_e23cabbc-eb5e-4793-9c7a-0742426de3a8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/28/sports/28norwaysports-sub/merlin_153967380_e23cabbc-eb5e-4793-9c7a-0742426de3a8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/28/sports/28norwaysports-sub/merlin_153967380_e23cabbc-eb5e-4793-9c7a-0742426de3a8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None