hen we stop believing?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/28/opinion/fourth-amendment-privacy.html', 'snippet': 'The courts have shielded information when we have a “reasonable expectation” it will stay private. What happens when we stop believing?', 'lead_paragraph': 'At any given moment, I’m usually carrying at least three different devices that track my location: a phone, a laptop and a Garmin watch. I carry these by choice, of course, and I’m well aware that they track my location in a variety of ways, including GPS satellites, wireless access points and cellphone towers, so I don’t expect my location to be secret when I have them on me. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/29/opinion/sunday/29Wolff/98a15f803bd14ef88eae88a38e218af7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 505, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/29/opinion/sunday/29Wolff/98a15f803bd14ef88eae88a38e218af7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 505}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/29/opinion/sunday/29Wolff/98a15f803bd14ef88eae88a38e218af7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 862, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/29/opinion/sunday/29Wolff/98a15f803bd14ef88eae88a38e218af7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1724, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/29/opinion/sunday/29Wolff/98a15f803bd14ef88eae88a38e218af7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': 