rd_count': 1301, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c893a3cb-2c3e-5aaa-9c47-1fa5b61775d1'}, {'abstract': 'Avoid it all you want, but you’re missing an incredible show.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/04/30/magazine/jury-duty-recommendation.html', 'snippet': 'Avoid it all you want, but you’re missing an incredible show.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the first things the lawyers told us was that serving on a jury would be nothing like the way it is on television. I guess they were trying to make us even less excited about having to be there. But I had already postponed the obligation three times, each time thinking that maybe someday I’d be less furious about having to surrender days of my life to the State of New York for nothing in return. That day never came, though my deferred jury summons did. I arrived seething.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/05/magazine/05mag-LOR-jury-pic/05mag-LOR-jury-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/05/magazine/05mag-LOR-jury-pic/05mag-LOR-jury-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/05/magazine/05mag-LOR-jury-pic/05mag-LOR-jury-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/05/magazine/05mag-LOR-jury-pic/05mag-LOR-jury-pic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/05/magazine/05mag-LOR-jury-pic/05mag-LOR-ju