opcorn, talking about staying grounded and assembling Ikea furniture: “Boom! I did it.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/30/arts/30knock3-promo/30knock3-promo-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 316, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/30/arts/30knock3-promo/30knock3-promo-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 316}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/30/arts/30knock3-promo/30knock3-promo-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 540, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/30/arts/30knock3-promo/30knock3-promo-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1079, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/30/arts/30knock3-promo/30knock3-promo-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/30/arts/30knock3-promo/30knock3-promo-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/30/arts/30knock3-promo/30knock3-promo-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Knock Down the House’ Review: Running to Win Hearts and Minds and Votes', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Pick', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Running to Win Hearts, Minds and Votes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [